2. The cost to change a character to another is the minimum distance on the circular alphabet
3. I can use dynamic programming with states (i, j, operations_left)

For each substring s[i...j] with `ops` operations remaining:
- Either skip one of the ends (don't include in palindrome)
- Or try to match the ends by changing both to some common character

